<title>JAPAN: Japanese feed talks seen concluding late-June.</title>
<headline>Japanese feed talks seen concluding late-June.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese soybean traders said on Monday that talks between crushers and feed makers on soymeal prices for the July-September period of this year are to be concluded later this month.</p>
<p>&quot;Feed makers are still discussing feed prices during the period. It'll take more time to reach a conclusion,&quot; a soybean trader at a major trade house said.</p>
<p>The soymeal price talks will determine Japanese soybean imports demand during the third quarter of 1997, industry officials said.</p>
